-- The determinant of a 3 × 3 matrix over a commutative ring as the
-- six-term Leibniz formula: the six permutations of 3 listed with their
-- signs, a finite sum over six listed points, and the expansion
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
